  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports route planning, fuel optimization, and delivery efficiency for a mixed-fleet 3PL running 28 vehicles (Semi / Truck / Van) across 10 metro depots. Stakeholders include the VP Logistics (lane performance, OTD), Fleet Manager (load utilization, deadhead, fuel efficiency), S&OP Lead (capacity planning), and CFO (cost per km, cost per delivery, scope-1 CO2 reporting).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Fuel cost per km = fuel_cost_usd / distance_km; healthy diesel semi ~$0.18–$0.30/km, vans lower\n- Load utilization = load_utilization_pct on route_segments; <70% indicates deadhead / under-loaded risk\n- Fuel efficiency = distance_km / fuel_consumed_liters; null for Electric vehicles\n- On-time delivery rate = on_time_delivery_pct on route_efficiency_metrics; target 95%+\n- Cost per delivery = cost_per_delivery_usd; primary unit-economics metric\n- CO2 emissions = co2_emissions_kg (scope-1, ~2.68 kg per liter diesel)\n- Traffic delay = traffic_delay_minutes per segment; congestion / route-quality signal\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - route_segments_metrics (source: route_segments) — dims: segment_date, vehicle_type, origin_location, destination_location, weather_condition; measures: total_distance_km, total_fuel_consumed_liters, total_fuel_cost_usd, avg_load_utilization_pct, avg_traffic_delay_minutes, segment_count, total_load_weight_kg, unique_vehicle_count, unique_route_count, max_distance_km.\n  - route_efficiency_metrics_mv (source: route_efficiency_metrics) — dims: week_start, vehicle_type, vehicle_id; measures: total_weekly_distance_km, total_weekly_fuel_liters, avg_on_time_delivery_pct, total_deliveries_completed, avg_cost_per_delivery_usd, total_co2_emissions_kg, max_total_distance_km.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. vehicle_name, fuel_type, home_depot, status, route_id).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show the monthly trend in total fuel cost across the network for the trailing 12 months.",
    "How has on-time delivery percentage trended month-over-month by vehicle type?",
    "Top 10 origin-destination lanes by total fuel cost over the last 90 days — which are dragging margin?",
    "Top 10 vehicles by cost per delivery last month, and what was their average load utilization?",
    "Which weather conditions correlate with the highest average traffic delay minutes?",
    "What is the total CO2 emissions trend monthly by vehicle type for scope-1 reporting?",
    "How does average load utilization compare across Semi, Truck, and Van fleets for the last 90 days?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How many distinct transactions appeared each month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', segment_date) AS month, COUNT(DISTINCT transaction) AS distinct_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_segments",
        "GROUP BY 1",
        "ORDER BY 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total segment distance in kilometers trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT segment_date, MEASURE(max_distance_km) AS max_distance_km",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_segments_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY segment_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How does weekly fuel consumption in liters vary by week start?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT week_start, MEASURE(total_weekly_fuel_liters) AS total_weekly_fuel_liters",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_efficiency_metrics_mv",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY total_weekly_fuel_liters DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Which vehicles have the highest total maximum load capacity in kilograms?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT vehicle_name, SUM(capacity_kg) AS total_metric",
        "FROM {fqn}.vehicles",
        "GROUP BY 1",
        "ORDER BY total_metric DESC",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total segment distance in kilometers over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT segment_date, SUM(distance_km) AS total_distance_km",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_segments",
        "GROUP BY segment_date ORDER BY segment_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average percentage of deliveries completed on time changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT week_start, AVG(on_time_delivery_pct) AS avg_on_time_delivery_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_efficiency_metrics",
        "GROUP BY week_start ORDER BY week_start"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Which vehicles are hauling the most cargo weight on average?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT vehicle_name, AVG(cargo_weight_kg) AS avg_cargo_kg",
        "FROM {fqn}.route_legs",
        "GROUP BY vehicle_name",
        "ORDER BY avg_cargo_kg DESC",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    }
  ],
